// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3880525251" "<em=lecture f=a>As a right-minded citizen of Praetoria, I'm sure you'd love to hear about Day Jobs.  Come talk to me."
// Script Variable RestrictedText :
"P3571593745" "I'm sorry, I don't have anything to talk to you about."
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable Leave :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DayJob 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page DayJobsHeroIntro Text :
"P3652477048" "<color deepskyblue>Day Job Recruiter</color><br><br>Hi, {HeroName}. I'm here to talk to you about the exciting world of <b>Day Jobs</b>.<br><br><color orange>Day Jobs are what you do when you're offline and not running around Praetoria maintaining the order and peace we enjoy here daily.</color><br><br>You earn Day Jobs by logging out in a Day Job location. While you're logged out you gain benefits thematically appropriate to your location. If you log out in the same location for 21 days (consecutively or non-consecutively) you will receive a Day Job badge. This will grant you additional benefits.<br><br>Also, collecting certain day job badges will grant you <color orange>Accolades</color> that come with even more benefits.<br><br>Is there anything else I can help you with?<br><br>"
// Answer Text :
"P3723737885" "Tell me more about specific day jobs and their rewards"
// Answer Text :
"P3789208128" "Tell me about day job accolades"
// Page DayJobsHeroSpecific Text :
"P3428981680" "<color deepskyblue>Day Job Recruiter</color><br><br>Ah, you want to know more about Day Jobs. Great. Well, here in Praetoria nearly everything is automated in one way or another, but we have a few day jobs for you to enjoy.  There are some specific locations and their benefits you get for 'working' there. You're going to have to explore to find all of them.<br><br><color orange>Caregiver</color>: Log out in a Hospital and for a limited time receive an out of combat regeneration bonus.<br><color orange>Professor</color>:  Log out in the Cultural Direction and Education Center and for a limited time receive a random piece of tech salvage when completing a mission.<br><color orange>Banker</color>: Log out in a Bank and for a limited time earn an Information Bonus when completing a mission.<br><br>I hope this helped clear things up. Now get out there and find the Day Job that's right for you."
// Answer Text :
"P812045085" "Return to main page"
// Page DayJobsVillainSpecific Text :
"P3193771690" "<color deepskyblue>Day Job Recruiter</color><br><br>Ah, you want to know more about Day Jobs. Great. Well, here in Praetoria nearly everything is automated in one way or another, but we have a few day jobs for you to enjoy.  Here are some specific locations and their benefits you get for 'working' there. You're going to have to explore to find all of them.<br><br><color orange>Pain Specialist</color>: Log out in a Hospital and for a limited time receive an out of combat regeneration bonus.<br><color orange>Professor</color>:  Log out in the Cultural Direction and Education Center and for a limited time receive a random piece of tech salvage when completing a mission.<br><color orange>Thief</color>: Log out in a Bank and for a limited time earn an Information Bonus when completing a mission.<br><color orange>Marketer</color>: Log out near the Trading House and for a limited time you will be granted a device that can quickly teleport you to the Trading House.<br><br>Hope this helped clear things up. Now get out there and find the Day Job that's right for you."
// Page DayJobAccoladesHero Text :
"P2524787426" "<color deepskyblue>Day Job Recruiter</color><br><br>If you earn two different day job badges that work together, you'll be granted an <color orange>accolade</color>. Earning an accolade will grant you even more benefits beyond the individual day job.<br><br>For example, earning both the <color orange>Caregiver</color> and <color orange>Professor</color> day job badges will earn you the <color orange>Physician Accolade</color>.  While logged out at a the Education Center or inside a Hospital you will earn charges for your Revive Ally power.<br><br>This is just one of the many accolades you can get for earning multiple day job badges. Have fun exploring and finding them all."
// Page DayJobAccoladesVillain Text :
"P1868858300" "<color deepskyblue>Day Job Recruiter</color><br><br>If you earn two different day job badges that work together, you'll be granted an <color orange>accolade</color>. Earning an accolade will grant you even more benefits beyond the individual day job.<br><br>For example, earning both the <color orange>Pain Specialist</color> and <color orange>Professor</color> day job badges will earn you the <color orange>Physician Accolade</color>.  While logged out at an Education Center or inside a Hospital you will earn charges for your Revive Ally power.<br><br>This is just one of the many accolades you can get for earning multiple day job badges. Have fun exploring and finding them all."
// Page Fallback Text :
"P1916959282" "<color deepskyblue>Day Job Recruiter</color><br><br>um? What was I saying?"
// DisplayName for N_DayJobRep :
"P2619164579" "Day Job Recruiter"

