// Script Variable RestrictedText :
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P3604108179" "Greetings, {HeroName}. <br><br>This is The Magisterium where all of the important decisions are made in Praetoria!  It's like the brain center of the entire city!  Do you see that building right behind me?  That's Cole Tower where the Emperor himself works!  Isn't that exciting?<br><br>Feel free to speak to Praetor Duncan at any time to train.  She's the lovely blonde with that amazing looking whip.<br><br>Do enjoy your stay and mind the perimeter warnings.  They are in effect for your absolute protection.  Have a lovely day."
// Script Variable Leave :
// DisplayName for N_Info :
"P506163520" "Magisterium Greeter"

