"P3506648387" "Welcome to Studio 55, {HeroName}.<br><br>This is <b>the</b> place in Praetoria to kick back, hang out, or dance.  Let our atmosphere take you to another dimension."
// Script Variable Leave :
"P462073646" "Rock on."
// DisplayName for N_Info :
"P2036512313" "Greeter"
